From: SJ Park <sj@kernel.org>
Date: Sun, 6 Sep 2026 09:40:46 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] mm/damon/paddr: fixup silent fallthrough caused by commit
 2315fab757a2

Building the tree generates below warning.  Fix it.

    .../mm/damon/paddr.c:220:20: warning: this statement may fall through [-Wimplicit-fallthrough=]
      220 |                 if (!folio)
          |                    ^
    .../mm/damon/paddr.c:224:9: note: here
      224 |         default:
          |         ^~~~~~~

Signed-off-by: SJ Park <sj@kernel.org>
---
 mm/damon/paddr.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/mm/damon/paddr.c b/mm/damon/paddr.c
index 6260c2abaf69a..d39b9a9c5c711 100644
--- a/mm/damon/paddr.c
+++ b/mm/damon/paddr.c
@@ -221,6 +221,7 @@ static bool damon_pa_filter_match(struct damon_filter *filter,
 			matched = false;
 		else
 			matched = damon_folio_young(folio) == false;
+		break;
 	default:
 		return damon_ops_filter_match(filter, folio);
 	}
-- 
